A quote-prefixed plus takes one space after each quote marker and attaches a quote

```
> +
q
.
<blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > +
q
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>+
q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
>+
q
.
<p>&gt;+
q</p>
```

```
>>+
q
.
<p>&gt;&gt;+
q</p>
```

```
> >+
q
.
<blockquote><p>&gt;+
q</p></blockquote>
```

```
>> +
q
.
<p>&gt;&gt; +
q</p>
```

```
> q
>+
> para
.
<blockquote><p>q
&gt;+
para</p></blockquote>
```

```
> > q
> +
> > r
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>q</p>
    <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> - a
> +
> > r
.
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>a
      <blockquote><p>r</p></blockquote>
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > - a
> +
> para
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>a</li>
    </ul>
    <p>para</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> a
> +
> > q
.
<blockquote>
  <p>a
+</p>
  <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> :: t
> : a
> +
> > q
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd>
      <p>a</p>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
    </dd>
  </dl>
</blockquote>
```

```
> [^a]: a
> +
> > q

r[^a]
.
<blockquote>

</blockquote>
<p>r<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></p>
<section role="doc-endnotes" aria-label="Footnotes">
  <hr>
  <ol>
    <li id="fn1">
      <p>a</p>
      <blockquote><p>q</p></blockquote>
      <p><a href="#fnref1" role="doc-backlink" aria-label="Back to reference">↩</a></p>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>
```
